Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:42:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/15] Round 5: Verify intervals with flat slots and a
 counting pass

Keep the verifier's three phases, checks and messages, but place each
movement in a prepared per-train leg slot and group movements by
resource with a stable counting pass. A group is sorted by entry only
when it is out of order. A randomized test compares verdicts and
messages with the 0.2.0 verifier on corrupted traces. The independent
domain validation passed against this round's CLI.

Workload: lean domain (48 candidates, 110 trains), 11 samples.
Before median: 1.286 ms. After median: 1.072 ms. Speedup: 1.20x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
